ight", "war", "space"], "long_description": "FCX is an action-packed flight combat game, sporting top notch 3D graphics and a progressively intense gameplay!\n\nMAIN FEATURES\n- Exciting, fast-paced arcade flight combat action\n- Top notch 3D graphics\n- Unique gorgeous fractal landscapes\n- Dozens of missions in Story mode\n- New missions every day!\n- Game controller support\n- Epic sound tracks\n- Multiple comfort and controls options", "short_description": "FCX is an action-packed flight combat game, sporting top notch 3D graphics and a progressively intense gameplay!"}, {"images": {"nodes": []}, "id": "612027526195064", "locale": "it_IT", "screenshots": [], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Fractal Combat X", "keywords": ["volo", "aerei", "combattimenti", "spazio", "guerra"], "long_description": "FCX e' un gioco di combattimenti aerei pieno di azione frenetica, grafica 3D mozzafiato e intenso gameplay!\n\nCARATTERISTICHE\n- Eccitanti combattimenti aerei\n- Grafica 3D mozzafiato\n- Dozzine di missioni in Story mode\n- Nuove missioni ogni giorno!\n- Supporto per gamepad\n- Epiche tracce sonore", "short_description": "FCX e' un gioco di combattimenti aerei pieno di azione frenetica, grafica 3D mozzafiato e intenso gameplay!"}, {"images": {"nodes": []}, "id": "562725297691475", "locale": "ja_JP", "screenshots": [], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "\u30d5\u30e9\u30af\u30bf\u30eb\u30fb\u30b3\u30f3\u30d0\u30c3\u30c8\u30fbX", "keywords": ["\u30b7\u30e5\u30fc\u30c6\u30a3\u30f3\u30b0", "\u7206\u5f3e", "\u6226\u95d8", "\u6226\u95d8\u6a5f", "\u5b87\u5b99"], "long_description": "\uff26\uff23\uff38\u306f\u8fd1\u672a\u6765\u7684\u306a\u30b9\u30d4\u30fc\u30c9\u611f\u3042\u3075\u308c\u308b3D\u3068VR\u30d5\u30e9\u30a4\u30c8\u30b3\u30f3\u30d0\u30c3\u30c8\u30b2\u30fc\u30e0\u3002\n\n\u7279\u5fb4\n \u2014 \u30a8\u30ad\u30b5\u30a4\u30c6\u30a3\u30f3\u30b0\u306a\u901f\u3044\u30da\u30fc\u30b9\u306e\u30a2\u30f